|---:|---:|---:|
| 1 | 0.127108913 | 0.080842366 |
| 2 | 0.082610521 | 0.077990791 |
| 3 | 0.080771579 | 0.076076347 |
Selected epoch 3; 96 updates; all eight first parameter gradients finite and nonzero.
\image(figures/recurrent_learning.svg)
